{
  "name": "drop-all-capabilities--drops-all-then-adds-sys-admin",
  "level": "unit",
  "description": "The only container drops ALL and then adds SYS_ADMIN, which grants mount, ptrace of any process and kernel-module loading — a standard container-escape primitive. PSS restricted and PSS baseline both reject it. Checking only the drop half reported this COMPLIANT (oracle class D, the highest-severity divergence found in this pack).",
